# Root `README.md` maintenance

Root **`README.md`** is the first-stop overview. Today it is a one-line stub. Expand it only when the change is something a new reader must see.

## When to update (same change)

- Build entry changes (`build.bat`, `gn` args, where `out/Debug` lands).
- A new top-level tree or user-facing binary is added or removed.
- A path or script the README already names is renamed.

## When not to touch

- Narrow bugfixes inside `ui/` / `base/` with no workflow change.
- Drive-by rewrites of the stub into a smartgis-style GN module table.

Keep edits minimal. Do not invent a “最后更新” line unless the README already has one.
